"When you leave Henge, the running Mac is saved to storage, and opening it again picks up where it was in a few seconds, even after iOS closes Henge. The save is about the size of the Mac's memory in use, compressed. The Mac pauses while Henge is in the background, so its sound stops. Experimental." = "离开 Henge 时，正在运行的 Mac 会保存到存储空间，再次打开几秒内即可恢复进度，即使 iOS 关闭了 Henge 也一样。保存大小约为 Mac 使用内存的压缩体积。Mac 在后台时会暂停，声音也会停止。实验性功能。";
